# ==========================================================
# TESTING - JEST / UNIT TESTS
# ==========================================================

# Cobertura generada por Jest
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/

# Caché de Jest
**/.jest/
**/.jest-cache/
**/jest-cache/

# Resultados de Jest
**/jest-results/
**/test-results/

# Snapshots generados
# NOTA: NO ignorar __snapshots__ porque normalmente
# deben versionarse junto con los tests.
# **/__snapshots__/


# ==========================================================
# UNIT TESTS - NODE / REACT / NESTJS
# ==========================================================

# Archivos temporales generados durante tests
**/*.test.log
**/*.spec.log

# Reportes de testing
**/test-reports/
**/test-report/
**/reports/


# ==========================================================
# E2E - PLAYWRIGHT
# ==========================================================

# Reportes de Playwright
**/playwright-report/
**/playwright-report/**

# Resultados de tests
**/test-results/
**/test-results/**

# Artefactos de Playwright
**/blob-report/
**/playwright/.cache/

# Videos y screenshots generados durante E2E
**/playwright/screenshots/
**/playwright/videos/
**/playwright/traces/


# ==========================================================
# E2E - CYPRESS
# ==========================================================

# Screenshots generados por Cypress
**/cypress/screenshots/

# Videos generados por Cypress
**/cypress/videos/

# Reportes Cypress
**/cypress/reports/

# Caché Cypress
**/.cypress/


# ==========================================================
# E2E - SELENIUM / WEBDRIVER
# ==========================================================

**/selenium/screenshots/
**/selenium/videos/
**/webdriver/screenshots/


# ==========================================================
# TESTING - GENERAL
# ==========================================================

# Archivos temporales de pruebas
**/test-output/
**/test-output/**

# Archivos de resultados XML
**/junit.xml
**/test-results.xml

# Reportes HTML generados por testing
**/test-report.html
**/test-results.html